  },
  "labels": "bond observed = terminal fragment of the MS3 precursor at the bond, 10 ppm after a run offset, -1/+1 isotope tried, on the offline deconvolution of FLASHDeconv with -SD:min_cos 0.85 0.85 0.5 (cosine 0.5 for MS3); covered = as the engine knew at enqueue",
  "origin": "models/final/w_ext_v3.json",
